- Fix install/runtime: add missing soname Requires (libasound.so.2,
  libgbm.so.1, libnspr4.so, libnss3.so, libnssutil3.so, libsmime3.so).
  The bundled Chromium binary could not launch after install because
  auto-requires for /opt/helium are excluded and the spec listed no
  runtime deps (zypper got "error while loading shared libraries:
  libnspr4.so").

